{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/kr/mn/gameplay_story/10602020.json":{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10602020","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10602020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1060202001:1":{"text":"<male>오빠</male><female>언니</female>, 혹시 레미 못 보셨어요?","source_cn":"<male>哥哥</male><female>姐姐</...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x07D50D29A725DFDD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<male>오빠</male><female>언니</female>, 혹시 레미 못 보셨어요?","female":"<male>오빠</male><female>언니</female>, 혹시 레미 못 보셨어요?","variant_male_record_index":"100541","variant_female_record_index":"100542","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1060202002:1":{"text":"레미는 황갈색 강아지예요. 얼굴, 가슴 그리고 네 발은 흰색인데, 자꾸 진흙탕에서 노는 바람에 꼬질꼬질해 보일 거예요...","source_cn":"雷米是一只黄色的小狗，它的脸和胸口，还有四只脚都是白色...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A8F6F66EDA0AE26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1060202002":{"text":"레미는 황갈색 강아지예요. 얼굴, 가슴 그리고 네 발은 흰색인데, 자꾸 진흙탕에서 노는 바람에 꼬질꼬질해 보일 거예요...","source_cn":"雷米是一只黄色的小狗，它的脸和胸口，还有四只脚都是白色的！不过它老在泥巴地里玩，可能看起来灰扑扑的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A8F6F66EDA0AE26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1060202003:1":{"text":"네... 조금 전까지는 여기 있었는데.","source_cn":"嗯……刚才还在这里的。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9D96AC19A0CCBAF2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"네... 조금 전까지는 여기 있었는데.","female":"네... 조금 전까지는 여기 있었는데.","variant_male_record_index":"100544","variant_female_record_index":"100545","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1060202004:1":{"text":"나가서 레미를 찾아보려고 했는데, 엄마가 장원 관리인이 무섭다고 나가지 말라고 해서...","source_cn":"我本来想去找它的，可是妈妈说庄园的看守很凶，叫我不要出去……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC82DA58CD4919D59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1060202005:1":{"text":"<male>오빠</male><female>언니</female>, 레미를 찾아주실 수 있나요? 아직 멀리 가지 못했을 거예요!","source_cn":"<male>哥哥</male><female>姐姐</...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7F2FBD283391F685","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<male>오빠</male><female>언니</female>, 레미를 찾아주실 수 있나요? 아직 멀리 가지 못했을 거예요!","female":"<male>오빠</male><female>언니</female>, 레미를 찾아주실 수 있나요? 아직 멀리 가지 못했을 거예요!","variant_male_record_index":"100547","variant_female_record_index":"100548","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1060202005":{"text":"<male>오빠</male><female>언니</female>, 레미를 찾아주실 수 있나요? 아직 멀리 가지 못했을 거예요!","source_cn":"<male>哥哥</male><female>姐姐</female>，你可以帮我找找雷米吗？它应该还没有跑远！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7F2FBD283391F685","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<male>오빠</male><female>언니</female>, 레미를 찾아주실 수 있나요? 아직 멀리 가지 못했을 거예요!","female":"<male>오빠</male><female>언니</female>, 레미를 찾아주실 수 있나요? 아직 멀리 가지 못했을 거예요!","variant_male_record_index":"100547","variant_female_record_index":"100548","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1060202006:1":{"text":"<male>오빠</male><female>언니</female>! 고마워요!","source_cn":"谢谢<male>哥哥</male><female>姐姐...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1C01601CC218C89E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<male>오빠</male><female>언니</female>! 고마워요!","female":"<male>오빠</male><female>언니</female>! 고마워요!","variant_male_record_index":"100549","variant_female_record_index":"100550","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1060202007:1":{"text":"아, 마침 밥 먹을 때가 되었네요. 이 방울을 드릴게요!","source_cn":"啊，刚好也到开饭时间了。这个摇铃给你！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x04D03C54A32776BB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"아, 마침 밥 먹을 때가 되었네요. 이 방울을 드릴게요!","female":"아, 마침 밥 먹을 때가 되었네요. 이 방울을 드릴게요!","variant_male_record_index":"100551","variant_female_record_index":"100552","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1060202009:1":{"text":"레미는 식탐이 많아서 <style=\"highlight\">방울 소리</style>가 들리면 집에 와서 밥 먹을 때가 왔다는 걸 알 거예요!","source_cn":"雷米很贪吃，只要听到摇铃的声音，它就知道该回家吃饭了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38CD5FEC1BE388C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"text":"알겠어","source_cn":"好吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2B1C33CF5BA2A66C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"알겠어","female":"알겠어","variant_male_record_index":"59390","variant_female_record_index":"59391","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1060202008:1":{"text":"음... 그럼 제가 이 방울을 드릴게요!","source_cn":"唔……那我把这个摇铃给你！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB0856A9990733587","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"음... 그럼 제가 이 방울을 드릴게요!","female":"음... 그럼 제가 이 방울을 드릴게요!","variant_male_record_index":"100553","variant_